body:
Bro every time i try to open the app and tap on my habits it just kicks me out of the app. Such a bummer and waste of time. Then why on GODS CREATION WOULD I SPEND MONEY ON A TASK APP?!!! Use your brain yall. I do not want to pay for another reminder. Why would you just give us 4 possible habits?! It&#39;s absolutely ridiculous and so unnecessary. 

The fact that it&#39;s buggy makes it so much worse and unnecessary and stupid! UGH! This app is so frustrating! I know that the devs are gonna either ignore me or just say &#34;We are very sorry for you dissatisfaction of our app. If you want to tell us more click on this sus ahh ahh email.&#34;

PLEASE Don&#39;t buy this app. Get google tasks instead or literally anything else. 

&#34;Love&#34;
- An angry customer

This app makes it easy to keep track of good habits so they become ingrained. 

Henry David Thoreau once wrote, “A single footstep will not make a path on the earth, so a single thought will not make a pathway in the mind. To make a deep physical path, we walk again and again. To make a deep mental path, we must think over and over the kind of thoughts we wish to dominate our lives.&#34; 

This app makes that process of making mental paths all the easier.
